WEBVTT

00:00:00.084 --> 00:00:04.438
In Fernwood, Nori found a tiny moon shivering beneath a leaf.

00:00:04.438 --> 00:00:06.453
Don’t worry, she whispered.

00:00:06.453 --> 00:00:08.000
I’ll take you home.

00:00:08.092 --> 00:00:10.677
At the dark river, Nori shared the moon’s glow.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:15.000
Stepping-stones sparkled one by one, making a safe path uphill.

00:00:15.093 --> 00:00:18.669
On the hilltop, Nori lifted the little moon.

00:00:18.669 --> 00:00:23.000
It floated home beside the stars, and all Fernwood twinkled below.

00:00:23.095 --> 00:00:24.640
Nori smiled.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:30.000
Even the smallest kindness can travel far and make a very big light for everyone who needs it.
